{"business": {"summary": "Persistent Systems is a US-focused IT services and digital engineering firm (~81% of revenue from North America) selling software engineering, cloud and AI-led transformation. It is mid-way through acquiring Germany's Nagarro, which would create a ~$2.9B combined company with a larger European business.",
